+## Finding 3 — the withdrawal fee accrues to nobody and is stranded forever — **High**
+
+`src/UsdtYieldVault.sol:117-119`
+
+```solidity
+totalAssetsStored -= grossAssets;                          // full gross leaves the accounting
+aavePool.withdraw(address(usdt), netAssets, msg.sender);   // only net leaves Aave
+```
+
+`README.md` and the contract's own NatSpec both state:
+
+> Both fees stay supplied in Aave and accrue to the remaining shareholders — they
+> are not swept to the owner.
+
+Half of that is true. The fee does stay in Aave. But `totalAssetsStored` is reduced
+by the **gross** amount, so the fee is deducted from the shareholders' claim at the
+same instant it stays in the pool. It accrues to no one. It is not swept to the owner
+either — the owner cannot reach it, because there is no sweep, rescue or skim
+function on the contract. It is simply destroyed.
+
+**Evidence** — two depositors, one exits; Bob is then the sole remaining shareholder
+and should receive the entire fee:
+
+```
+$ forge test --match-path test/AccountingRegression.t.sol --match-test test_WithdrawFeeDoesNotAccrueToRemainingShareholders -vv
+
+Ran 1 test for test/AccountingRegression.t.sol:AccountingRegressionTest
+[FAIL: every aUSDT the vault holds must be claimable by a shareholder: 3001500 != 0] test_WithdrawFeeDoesNotAccrueToRemainingShareholders() (gas: 367115)
+Logs:
+  gross assets alice was owed     : 1000500250
+  net assets alice received       : 997498750
+  withdrawal fee retained in Aave : 3001500
+  bob's claim before alice exited : 999499749
+  bob's claim after  alice exited : 999499750
+  bob's gain from the fee         : 1
+  share price before              : 1001501
+  share price after               : 1001501
+  aUSDT owned but owned by no one : 3001500
+
+Suite result: FAILED. 0 passed; 1 failed; 0 skipped; finished in 1.21ms (309.59µs CPU time)
+
+Ran 1 test suite in 8.32ms (1.21ms CPU time): 0 tests passed, 1 failed, 0 skipped (1 total tests)
+
+Failing tests:
+Encountered 1 failing test in test/AccountingRegression.t.sol:AccountingRegressionTest
+[FAIL: every aUSDT the vault holds must be claimable by a shareholder: 3001500 != 0] test_WithdrawFeeDoesNotAccrueToRemainingShareholders() (gas: 367115)
+
+Encountered a total of 1 failing tests, 0 tests succeeded
+```
+
+Fee retained in Aave: **3.001500 USDT**. Bob's gain: **1 wei** — rounding dust, not
+the fee. Share price before and after: identical, `1001501`.
+
+Once everybody exits, the stranded amount is permanent:
+
+```
+$ forge test --match-path test/AccountingRegression.t.sol --match-test test_AssetsAreStrandedAfterEveryoneExits -vv
+
+Ran 1 test for test/AccountingRegression.t.sol:AccountingRegressionTest
+[FAIL: vault must not retain unclaimable assets once all shares are burned: 5999999 != 0] test_AssetsAreStrandedAfterEveryoneExits() (gas: 369242)
+Logs:
+  totalShares                     : 0
+  totalAssetsStored               : 0
+  aUSDT still owned by the vault  : 5999999
+  ...i.e. USDT permanently stuck  : 5999999
+
+Suite result: FAILED. 0 passed; 1 failed; 0 skipped; finished in 1.12ms (275.98µs CPU time)
+
+Ran 1 test suite in 7.66ms (1.12ms CPU time): 0 tests passed, 1 failed, 0 skipped (1 total tests)
+
+Failing tests:
+Encountered 1 failing test in test/AccountingRegression.t.sol:AccountingRegressionTest
+[FAIL: vault must not retain unclaimable assets once all shares are burned: 5999999 != 0] test_AssetsAreStrandedAfterEveryoneExits() (gas: 369242)
+
